U_kgDOBnfpvA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108521916?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm","html_url":"https://github.com/gregatm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-22T16:16:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T22:03:38Z","body":"I started implementing making the watcher logs available in the UI\n\nhttps://github.com/gregatm/airflow/commit/8a5cf7a05960721d1d2fcfa682117b7e6b987687\n\nIt is certainly in a WIP state.\n\nNotable things I did are:\n\n### triggerer_job_runner.py\n* A separate logger is attached to watchers, previously, none was attached and the normal process logger was used\n* Added a separate WatcherLoggingFactory complementing the existing TriggerLoggingFactory. It has a Trigger property instead of the TaskInstance.\n  * Logging to file is optional and currently disabled by default. For it to work you have to set the new config `AIRFLOW__TRIGGER__LOG_TO_FILE` to `True` (subject to change)\n\n### ui/AssetWatcher\n* Added a detail page for AssetWatchers\n  * Shows the triggerer the watcher is runnning on\n  * Shows last heartbeat of the triggerer\n  * Shows the log associated to the trigger\n* Is accessible through Assets->AssetDetail->Watchers->WatcherPopOver\n\n### fastapi/core_api/routes/ui/assetwatcher.py\n* New endpoint for retrieving a single assetwatcher\n* New endpoint for retrieving logs\n\n### log_reader.py/WatcherLogReader\n* Complements TaskLogReader\n* Used in endpoint to retrieve logs\n\n### file_watcher_handler.py\n* Complements file_task_handler.py for triggers/assetwatchers\n\nI tried to keep the changes out of existing code, and leave it as untouched as possible. But obviously it can also be coupled more tightly.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/6345575011/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"gregatm","id":108521916,"node_id":"U_kgDOBnfpvA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108521916?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm","html_url":"https://github.com/gregatm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregatm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}}]]
